<title>HUNGARY: Tesco boosts Global stake to 95 pct.</title>
<headline>Tesco boosts Global stake to 95 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retailer Tesco Plc raised its stake in its Hungarian unit Global TH Rt to 95 percent, Global said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Tesco acquired an additional 838,745 shares in Global, it said. The statement did not indicate how Tesco acquired these shares.</p>
<p>Global has an issued share capital of 3.83 billion forints. Further information was not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom + 36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
